title: The Diffs section of Source Control: mode chooser, only the files with changes, then with the other files of their folders, then with their dependency neighbours, and the unchanged lines collapsed or expanded
folders: git-diffs
expect-log: showing 2 files: changed
expect-log: showing 4 files: changed, their folders
expect-log: showing 3 files: changed, their neighbours
expect-log: showing 5 files: changed, their folders, their neighbours
forbid-log: script: ignoring

wait 3500
left changes
wait 900
mark 1-panel
wait 500
changed on
wait 1500
mark 2-only-changed
wait 500
diff on
diff together
wait 1500
mark 3-unified
wait 500
changed folders on
wait 1500
mark 4-folders
wait 500
changed folders off
changed neighbours on
wait 1500
mark 5-neighbours
wait 500
changed folders on
wait 1500
mark 6-folders-and-neighbours
wait 500
diff split
wait 1500
mark 7-split
wait 500
diff unfold
wait 1000
mark 8-expand
wait 500
changed off
wait 1500
mark 9-all
wait 500
quit
